+## Sales (schema 3)
+
+- Schema 2 migrates to schema 3 by adding an empty `sales` collection and
+  `seq.sale` counter; existing records are preserved.
+- Sales have an id, ticket, soldAt (normalized UTC instant), dishId, qty, and
+  an `ingredients` snapshot of scaled `{ itemId, qty }` recipe requirements.
+  Snapshots preserve historical theoretical use when recipes change.
+- A file imports atomically, including stock, movements, sales and sequences.
+  A previously imported ticket is skipped in full. Multiple rows for a new
+  ticket are all imported together.
